    "detailed_description": "<h1>Notice</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear Players,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the game's roots in Chinese mythology and memes, as well as budget constraints, the English translation was done mechanically. We hope you understand and appreciate your support!<br>*This is Elder version.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/2ec3ead24a51036d91a1208707f9741b.poster.avif?t=1749607054\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/2ec3ead24a51036d91a1208707f9741b.webm?t=1749607054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/2ec3ead24a51036d91a1208707f9741b.mp4?t=1749607054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>Arisen Force: Life Devotee </strong> is an challenging A-RPG game featuring exquisite <strong>high-definition pixels</strong> ,it combines the engaging Stylish Actional combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels design is base on  one part of storylines of <i>Journey to the West</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Battle</strong>: Experience high-octane, stylized action designed for maximum enjoyment and tactical depth..   \t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Blend of Old and New</strong>: Encounter a unique mix of classic gameplay elements and modern design, featuring challenging adversaries and ingenious level architecture.,  \t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Battle Environments</strong>: Journey through each hero\u2019s distinct thematic setting, enjoying diverse and visually stunning combat scenarios.  \t</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are numerous combat skills to explore in action games, including Evade, Charging Attack, Block, Counter, Punish, Just System, Cancel, and Throw/Execute. Dive in and discover your favorites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/782d85b2e04b5ca5e6ec426eed6f3a78.poster.avif?t=1749607054\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/782d85b2e04b5ca5e6ec426eed6f3a78.webm?t=1749607054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/782d85b2e04b5ca5e6ec426eed6f3a78.mp4?t=1749607054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/2ec3ead24a51036d91a1208707f9741b.poster.avif?t=1749607054\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/2ec3ead24a51036d91a1208707f9741b.webm?t=1749607054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/2ec3ead24a51036d91a1208707f9741b.mp4?t=1749607054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>Arisen Force: Life Devotee </strong> is an challenging A-RPG game featuring exquisite <strong>high-definition pixels</strong> ,it combines the engaging Stylish Actional combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels design is base on  one part of storylines of <i>Journey to the West</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Battle</strong>: Experience high-octane, stylized action designed for maximum enjoyment and tactical depth..   \t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Blend of Old and New</strong>: Encounter a unique mix of classic gameplay elements and modern design, featuring challenging adversaries and ingenious level architecture.,  \t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Battle Environments</strong>: Journey through each hero\u2019s distinct thematic setting, enjoying diverse and visually stunning combat scenarios.  \t</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are numerous combat skills to explore in action games, including Evade, Charging Attack, Block, Counter, Punish, Just System, Cancel, and Throw/Execute. Dive in and discover your favorites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/782d85b2e04b5ca5e6ec426eed6f3a78.poster.avif?t=1749607054\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/782d85b2e04b5ca5e6ec426eed6f3a78.webm?t=1749607054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279120/extras/782d85b2e04b5ca5e6ec426eed6f3a78.mp4?t=1749607054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
